ques de vos joueurs pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s, les 4 courts principaux en direct... au sein d'une exp\u00e9rience immersive VIP con\u00e7ue pour vous !", "short_description": "L'application Roland Garros VR est l'application officielle de R\u00e9alit\u00e9 Virtuelle que France TVSport met \u00e0 votre disposition pendant toute la comp\u00e9tition. Retrouvez-y un contenu exclusif, avec la possibilit\u00e9 de vous immerger au sein du court Philippe Chatrier gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des cam\u00e9ras grand angle et 360 pour suivre les matchs comme si vous y \u00e9tiez."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.francetelevisions.fr/confidentialite", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.francetelevisions.fr/confidentialite", "publisher_name": "France televisions", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://sport.francetvinfo.fr/roland-garros", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["SPORTS", "SIMULATION", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["fr"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "250329237291966"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162675_1832696350390243_8397745371123548160_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tOvpMo-BVHIQ7kNvwH-O5v5&_nc_oc=AdoRErg4nvPxMBnkhZFHckUgiqz9_VMiylOFpruu-CKOfImpl3kEWgcO3-MjD_8-lXs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0FgLwIutF-vwBV8fxDdkHI8tkRpgtEeW6EmkS2L1KNhw&oe=69F1F62D"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_t